                                "sense_id": "9bd64c6e-ba46-386c-94f2-3ab2e9f26066",
                                "text": "A day earlier, state epidemiologist Dr. Paul Byers warned the minimal available ICU capacity meant dozens of patients are waiting in emergency rooms for an ICU bed. […] “We desperately needed the nursing support because our ICUs are so inundated with critically ill Covid patients,” Brown said."
